        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are assisting me while I'm on the phone with the customer right now. Customer just called in and I am overwhelmed with data. \nI have the following Zendesk user details and I would like you to tell me the customer's name and email, based on all the data available to you. If you can't identify a name for the user, then just output \"Unknown Caller\". You should only output the name and email nothing else. You would just output a json, like this:\n{\n\"name\":\"full name or 'Unknown Caller' as a string value\",\n\"first_name\": \"only the first name or 'Unknown Caller' as a string value\"\n\"email\":\"email address or 'No email on record' as a string value\"\n}\n\nAnything that you would output outside the name or email as structured above  would be interpreted incorrectly, so please avoid it.\nHere are the user details that I have:\nI found {{ $('Edit Fields2').first().json[\"Results Count\"] }} profiles, with the following names listed:\n{{ $items(\"Search for the user in Zendesk\").map(item => item.json.name) }}\nHere are all the emails listed associated with these profiles:\n{{ $items(\"Search for the user in Zendesk\").map(item => item.json.email) }}\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {}
